msgstr "OPTIONS"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-V>,B< -Version>"
msgstr "B<-V>,B< -Version>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Print the version of the B<ip> utility and exit."
msgstr "Afficher la version de l'utilitaire B<ip> et quitter."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-h>,B< -human>,B< -human-readable>"
msgstr "B<-h>,B< -human>,B< -human-readable>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "output statistics with human readable values followed by suffix."
msgstr ""
"Statistiques de sortie avec des valeurs humainement lisibles et suivies d'un "
"suffixe."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-b>,B< -batch >E<lt>FILENAMEE<gt>"
msgstr "B<-b>,B< -batch >E<lt>NOM_FICHIERE<gt>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Read commands from provided file or standard input and invoke them.  First "
"failure will cause termination of ip."
msgstr ""
"Lire les commandes depuis le fichier fourni ou l'entrée standard et les "
"exécuter. Le premier échec causera l'arrêt de B<ip>."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-force>"
msgstr "B<-force>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Don't terminate ip on errors in batch mode.  If there were any errors during "
"execution of the commands, the application return code will be non zero."
msgstr ""
"Ne pas arrêter B<ip> à cause d'erreurs en mode « batch ». Si des erreurs "
"surviennent lors de l'exécution des commandes, le code de retour de "
"l'application sera différent de zéro."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-s>,B< -stats>,B< -statistics>"
msgstr "B<-s>,B< -stats>,B< -statistics>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Output more information. If the option appears twice or more, the amount of "
"information increases.  As a rule, the information is statistics or some "
"time values."
msgstr ""
"Afficher plus d'informations en sortie. Si l'option apparait deux fois ou "
"plus, le nombre d'informations augmente. En général, les informations sont "
"des statistiques ou des valeurs de temps."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-d>,B< -details>"
msgstr "B<-d>,B< -details>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Output more detailed information."
msgstr "Afficher des informations plus détaillées."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-l>,B< -loops >E<lt>COUNTE<gt>"
msgstr "B<-l>,B< -loops >E<lt>NOMBREE<gt>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Specify maximum number of loops the 'ip address flush' logic will attempt "
"before giving up. The default is 10.  Zero (0) means loop until all "
"addresses are removed."
msgstr ""
"Indiquer le nombre maximal de boucles que la logique de « vidage d'adresses "
"ip » doit essayer avant d'abandonner. Le nombre par défaut est B<10>. Zéro "
"(B<0>) signifie boucler jusqu'à ce que toutes les adresses soient supprimées."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-f>,B< -family >E<lt>FAMILYE<gt>"
msgstr "B<-f>,B< -family >E<lt>FAMILLEE<gt>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Specifies the protocol family to use. The protocol family identifier can be "
"one of B<inet>,B< inet6>,B< bridge>,B< mpls> or B<link>.  If this option is "
"not present, the protocol family is guessed from other arguments. If the "
"rest of the command line does not give enough information to guess the "
"family, B<ip> falls back to the default one, usually B<inet> or B<any>.  "
"B<link> is a special family identifier meaning that no networking protocol "
"is involved."
msgstr ""
"Indiquer la famille de protocoles à utiliser. L'identifiant de la famille de "
"protocoles peut être : B<inet>,B< inet6>, B< bridge>,B< mpls> ou B<link>. Si "
"cette option n'est pas présente, la famille de protocoles est présumée "
"d'après les autres arguments. Si le reste de la ligne de commande ne donne "
"pas assez d'informations pour deviner la famille, B<ip> se rabat sur celle "
"par défaut, généralement B<inet> ou B<any>. B<link> est un identifiant "
"spécial de famille signifiant qu'aucun protocole réseau n'est engagé."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-4>"
msgstr "B<-4>"

