msgstr "B<-0>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "shortcut for B<-family link>."
msgstr "Raccourci pour B<-family link>."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-o>,B< -oneline>"
msgstr "B<-o>,B< -oneline>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"output each record on a single line, replacing line feeds with the B<'\\e'> "
"character. This is convenient when you want to count records with B<wc>(1)  "
"or to B<grep>(1)  the output."
msgstr ""
"Écrire en sortie chaque enregistrement sur une seule ligne en remplaçant les "
"sauts de ligne par le caractère « B<\\e> ». Cela est pratique lorsque vous "
"voulez compter les enregistrements avec B<wc>(1) ou pour une recherche avec "
"B<grep>(1) sur la sortie."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-r>,B< -resolve>"
msgstr "B<-r>,B< -resolve>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"use the system's name resolver to print DNS names instead of host addresses."
msgstr ""
"Utiliser le résolveur de noms du système pour afficher les noms DNS au lieu "
"des adresses d'hôte."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-n>,B< -netns >E<lt>NETNSE<gt>"
msgstr "B<-n>,B< -netns >E<lt>NETNSE<gt>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"switches B<ip> to the specified network namespace I<NETNS>.  Actually it "
"just simplifies executing of:"
msgstr ""
"Commuter B<ip> sur l'espace de noms de réseau I<NETNS> spécifié. En fait "
"cela simplifie juste l'exécution de :"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"B<ip netns exec> I<NETNS> B<ip> [ I<OPTIONS> ] I<OBJECT> { I<COMMAND> | "
"B<help> }"
msgstr ""
"B<ip netns exec> I<NETNS> B<ip> [ I<OPTIONS> ] I<OBJET> { I<COMMANDE> | "
"B<help> }"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "to"
msgstr "à"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"B<ip> -n[etns] I<NETNS> [ I<OPTIONS> ] I<OBJECT> { I<COMMAND> | B<help> }"
msgstr ""
"B<ip> B<-n>[etns] I<NETNS> [ I<OPTIONS> ] I<OBJET> { I<COMMANDE> | B<help> }"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-N>,B< -Numeric>"
msgstr "B<-N>,B< -Numeric>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Print the number of protocol, scope, dsfield, etc directly instead of "
"converting it to human readable name."
msgstr ""
"Afficher directement le numéro de protocole, de portée, de champ DS, etc., "
"au lieu de le convertir en un nom lisible par un humain."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-a>,B< -all>"
msgstr "B<-a>,B< -all>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"executes specified command over all objects, it depends if command supports "
"this option."
msgstr ""
"Exécuter la commande indiquée sur tous les objets si la commande gère cette "
"option."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-c>[B<color>][B<=>{B<always>|B<auto>|B<never>}"
msgstr "B<-c>[B<color>][B<=>{B<always>|B<auto>|B<never>}"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Configure color output. If parameter is omitted or B<always>, color output "
"is enabled regardless of stdout state. If parameter is B<auto>, stdout is "
"checked to be a terminal before enabling color output. If parameter is "
"B<never>, color output is disabled. If specified multiple times, the last "
"one takes precedence. This flag is ignored if B<-json> is also given."
msgstr ""
"Configurer la couleur en sortie. Si le paramètre est omis ou si B<always> "
"est présent, la sortie en couleur est activée quel que soit l'état de "
"stdout. Si le paramètre est B<auto>, il est vérifié que stdout est un "
"terminal avant d'activer la sortie en couleur. Si le paramètre est B<never>, "
"la sortie en couleur est désactivée. Si ce paramètre est indiqué plusieurs "
"fois, le dernier prend la priorité. Ce drapeau est ignoré si B<-json> est "
"aussi donné."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Used color palette can be influenced by B<COLORFGBG> environment variable "
"(see B<ENVIRONMENT>)."
msgstr ""
"La palette de couleurs utilisée peut être influencée par la variable "
"d'environnement B<COLORFGBG> (voir B<ENVIRONNEMENT>)."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-t>,B< -timestamp>"
msgstr "B<-t>,B< -timestamp>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "display current time when using monitor option."
msgstr "Afficher le temps actuel en utilisant l'option B<monitor>."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-ts>,B< -tshort>"
msgstr "B<-ts>,B< -tshort>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Like B<-timestamp>, but use shorter format."
msgstr "Comme B<-timestamp>, mais utilisant un format plus petit."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
